---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Technology"
  description="Purpose-built technology and AI-powered workflows that give our real estate operations a structural advantage."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">Technology</p>
      <h1>Tools that create<br /><span class="accent">structural advantage</span></h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          We build and deploy purpose-built technology to streamline every phase of
          real estate operations &mdash; from market analysis to portfolio management.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Technology Stack</h2>
        <p>
          Rather than relying solely on off-the-shelf SaaS tools, we build custom
          systems that compound operational efficiency over time. Our stack is designed
          for speed, reliability, and maintainability.
        </p>

        <h2>AI-Powered Workflows</h2>
        <p>
          We leverage AI orchestration to automate research, analysis, and reporting
          tasks that traditionally require significant manual effort. Our AI workflows
          handle market research, comparable analysis, and due diligence preparation
          while maintaining human oversight on all critical decisions.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          Clean data is the foundation of good decisions. We build data pipelines
          that aggregate property data, market indicators, and portfolio metrics
          into unified views that enable fast, confident decision-making.
        </p>

        <h2>Open Source Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Where possible, we contribute tooling and methodology back to the community.
          We believe that transparency in our approach builds trust and drives the
          industry forward.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
